ない。","nextNodeIds":[740450413]},{"nodeId":740450413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":2424316498,"text":"だから、鑑定を頼みに来たってわけだな？","nextNodeIds":[740450419]},{"nodeId":740450419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":4093412522,"text":"でもこんな鉱石が一つしかないなんて、本当に残念なことだ…","nextNodeIds":[740450420]},{"nodeId":740450420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":3022170306,"text":"もし十分な量さえあれば、フォンテーヌ全土を席巻できるくらい人気の装飾品を作れるかもしれないんだが。","nextNodeIds":[740450421]},{"nodeId":740450421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":104420466,"text":"（たしか、この石ころは鉱脈周辺の至るところにあるって、プーカが言ってたよな。あいつに聞けば…）","nextNodeIds":[740450422,740450424,740450427]},{"nodeId":740450422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1271319674,"text":"こんな鉱石は結構持ってる。","nextNodeIds":[740450423]},{"nodeId":740450423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":3488439002,"text":"本当か、それはよかった！","nextNodeIds":[740450430]},{"nodeId":740450430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":1844141338,"text":"そしたら、君たちが持ってる鉱石を買わせてもらおう。それに君たちのルートを通して、さらに多くの鉱石を買い入れ、工芸品を作りたいんだ。","nextNodeIds":[740450431]},{"nodeId":740450431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":1647645554,"text":"もちろん誠意を表すために、代金は先払いさせてもらうよ。今度来た時に、もっと多くの鉱石を持ってきてくれたらいいさ。","nextNodeIds":[740450432]},{"nodeId":740450432,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":2728949338,"text":"どうだい、公平な取引だと思うけど、君たちはどうかな？","nextNodeIds":[740450433]},{"nodeId":740450433,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":69371570,"text":"へへ、オイラも悪くないと思うぜ。じゃあ取引は成立だな！","nextNodeIds":[740450434]},{"nodeId":740450434,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":2850212250,"text":"それは本当によかった。これは品物の代金だ…","nextNodeIds":[740450435]},{"nodeId":740450435,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":944707234,"text":"この宝石でどんな装飾品ができるかな。ははは、今から楽しみだ。","nextNodeIds":[740450436]},{"nodeId":740450436,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":341521458,"text":"じゃ、私はここでいい知らせを待ってるよ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":740450424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2423686090,"text":"供給元は企業機密。","nextNodeIds":[740450425]},{"nodeId":740450425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":3723760538,"text":"ああ、それもそうだな…","nextNodeIds":[740450426]},{"nodeId":740450426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":2744242610,"text":"でも、君たちが仕入れのルートを知ってるならそれでいい。","nextNodeIds":[740450430]},{"nodeId":740450427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":813936322,"text":"実は「エリナス」のところにたくさんある。","nextNodeIds":[740450428]},{"nodeId":740450428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3088547098,"text":"おい、あっけなく言っちゃうのかよ！","nextNodeIds":[740450429]},{"nodeId":740450429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":5096,"speakerName":"チェシル","textMapHash":1340979850,"text":"なるほど、「エリナス」のところで見つけたのか？確かに、鉱脈の奥深くまで入る人はあまりいないしな…","nextNodeIds":[740450430]},{"nodeId":740450414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1603689538,"text":"「パイパイ石」とかいう鉱石かも？","nextNodeIds":[740450415]},{"nodeId":740450415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1246081514,"text":"おい、変な名前をつけんなよ！","nextNodeIds":[740450419]},{"nodeId":740450416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1560921778,"text":"それはもちろん「きらきら琉璃色の金」だ。","nextNodeIds":[740450417]},{"nodeId":740450417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":283257594,"text":"うっ、それ…たったいま思